Saya Couple — REQUIRED core patch for ComfyUI (comfy/ldm/modules/attention.py).
Adds the forced attn2 path used by SayaMultiCouple dual_attention_enabled (saya_dual_mode):
MAIN native attn2 + P1/P2 on cond rows only, fused by main_locked_delta with PERSON gain 0.78.
Without it, dual attention mode cannot work. Base: ComfyUI upstream 41db8f4f.

